{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫電視邁向59周年盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》正式揭開紅地氈序幕。歷屆與應屆香港小姐於將軍澳電視廣播城施展渾身解數爭妍鬥麗，當中王敏慈與莊子璇等新生代佳麗互不相讓。這場鎂光燈下驚艷角力背後隱藏無數令人意外震撼細節。</p>\n<h2>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》群星拱照大騷曼妙身段</h2>\n<p>年度壓軸盛會《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日傍晚時分於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，大批視后級花旦與新生代小花傾巢而出。</p>\n<h2>今屆港姐冠亞季以及友誼小姐</h2>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-1228_1381649106afec87dda255-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶 王敏慈 （圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-1228_1381649106afec87dda255-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB娛樂新聞台）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>廖慧儀</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-30_15774238766afeca19ce58b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-30_15774238766afeca19ce58b.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></a></p>\n<h2>葉蒨文</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-32_6735960076afecae3b5931.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-32_6735960076afecae3b5931.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></a></p>\n<h2>李芷晴</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-33_7036457136afecc12760f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-33_7036457136afecc12760f0.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></a></p>\n<h2>陳楨怡</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-34_21121428406afecc9404ff4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/_-34_21121428406afecc9404ff4.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></a></p>\n<h2>戴祖儀郭柏妍鄺潔楹</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3110_6258087586afecd7a58adb-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3110_6258087586afecd7a58adb-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3038_2011440656afecd7e8ef61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3038_2011440656afecd7e8ef61.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></a></p>\n<h2>黃嘉雯張寶兒王菲</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3556_7602290936afed1adf0866-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3556_7602290936afed1adf0866-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p> <a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3535_1084195526afed1b190cee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/vs-youtube-youtube-3535_1084195526afed1b190cee.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.960013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":470,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:10:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:36.266667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:49.220746+00:00","content_hash":"e836c8325107459691916754457e33e95fca96b7d5bdfb64fef6bcb2bc2b00f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}